# .NET build artefacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

# Visual Studio
**/.vs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.suo

# Legacy NuGet packages folder (pre-PackageReference; should be empty post-net8 migration)
**/packages/

# Logs
**/Logs/
*.log

# Node / Vite / frontend
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/.vite-temp/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Local env files (committed defaults stay in .env / .env.development / .env.production)
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Misc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
